---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<ul class="reqs">
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="hdr" /></span>
    <div><h3>An AMD Radeon graphics card</h3><p>VaporOS streams with AMD GPUs on the <code>amdgpu</code> driver. NVIDIA and Intel graphics aren't supported yet.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="cpu" /></span>
    <div><h3>An x86-64-v3 processor</h3><p>Intel Haswell, AMD Zen, or newer.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="lock" /></span>
    <div><h3>UEFI, with Secure Boot off</h3><p>The kernel isn't signed for Secure Boot. Legacy BIOS boot isn't supported.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="drive" /></span>
    <div><h3>A drive of at least 24.5 GiB</h3><p>About 26.3 GB; 32 GB or larger is recommended. VaporOS takes the whole drive. Steam libraries on other drives can stay and be used.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="ethernet" /></span>
    <div><h3>A network cable</h3><p>Setup happens over your home network, and Wake-on-LAN needs a wired connection.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <span class="req-ico"><Icon name="usb" /></span>
    <div><h3>A USB stick and a screen, to install</h3><p>Everything on the stick is erased when you write the ISO. A monitor or TV shows the setup code during the install; you don't need it afterwards.</p></div>
  </li>
</ul>

<style>
  .reqs { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .reqs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; } }
  .reqs li {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 18px 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--glass), rgb(14 22 31 / .5);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .req-ico {
    position: relative;
    display: grid; place-items: center; flex: none;
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px;
    color: var(--brand); background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
  }
  .req-ico :global(.ico) { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .req-ico::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; right: -5px; bottom: -5px;
    width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ok) url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%2303111f' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M20 6 9 17l-5-5'/></svg>") center / 10px no-repeat;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--bg);
  }
  .reqs h3 { font-family: var(--font); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.35; }
  .reqs p { margin-top: 4px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: .94rem; }
</style>
